  "notes": [
    "PoseA Config.asset has <InteractionConfig>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0} (no interaction asset assigned) and EnableMeter=0, so PoseA interaction values are all null.",
    "The serialized touchAnimation and moodAnimationKey fields are absent from all four 'Pose{A..D} Animator Binding Config.asset' files; recorded as null.",
    "costumeDefaults is a single shared component: 'Spine Costume' GameObject MonoBehaviour fileID 4761 in Main.unity (empty strings for headSkin/faceSkin/upperBodySkin/lowerBodySkin/accessorySkin).",
    "Spine Costume poseId->SkeletonDataAsset map (Main.unity fileID 4761): 101=PoseA_SkeletonData, 102=PoseB_SkeletonData, 103=PoseC_SkeletonData, 104=PoseD_SkeletonData.",
    "Animator parameter cross-check: PoseA_Controller params are click, Keyboard, Touch, Talking, Mood. PoseA binding nevertheless lists startAnimation 'Start', inputTriggers Click_1/Click_2/Click_3, filledAnimation 'Orgasm', resetAnimation 'Reset' — none of those exist in PoseA_Controller; the zone touchAnimation 'Touch' does exist.",
    "Animator parameter cross-check: PoseB/C/D controllers contain Start, Click_1..3, Orgasm, Reset and per-zone Touch_* triggers, but no 'Keyboard' or 'click' parameters (binding keyboardAnimation/mouseAnimation values); listenInputDevice is false for B/C/D so these are not fired there.",
    "PoseB Controller has Touch_1, Touch_2, Touch_3L, Touch_3R matching its 4 zones; PoseC has Touch_1, Touch_2, Touch_ChestL, Touch_ChestR; PoseD has Touch_1, Touch_2, Touch_3.",
    "desk.desktopSkin/underDeskSkin/desktopBSkin are serialized as empty strings in '_Main/CharacterAssets/Spine/Desk  Costume.prefab' (lines 141-143); no baseSkins config field exists anywhere — desk.baseSkins was extracted by parsing the Spine 4.3.11 binary 'TextAsset/DefaultDesk.skel.bytes'.",
    "DefaultDesk.skel.bytes also contains 39 per-prop skins not listed in baseSkins: 22 'Desktop/*', 10 'DesktopB/*', 7 'UnderDesk/*'.",
    "interactionRunner values read from Main.unity MonoBehaviour fileID 4238 ('Interaction System Runner'): defaultPoseId 101, idleResetTimeout 60, poseConfigOrder follows the serialized poseConfigs list order."
  ]
